to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}strong\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\preceq_K\\subseteq K\\times K\\land\\forall A\\in K\\;(\\langle A,A\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in K\\;((\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\land\\langle B,C\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\to\\langle A,C\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\land\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\to\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(A,B,L))\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}strong\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\preceq_K\\subseteq K\\times K\\land\\forall A\\in K\\;(\\langle A,A\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in K\\;((\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\land\\langle B,C\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\to\\langle A,C\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K)\\land\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\to\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(A,B,L))\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\preceq_K\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The strong-substructure relation is explicit data: it is a preorder on a same-language set of structures and every strong pair is an ordinary substructure pair.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","